 "differences": [
  "The deposit does not reproduce the preprint v1 statistics (it may be a later version): paired t EMG vs force over 36 participants is -1.71 (paper -2.24), Spearman rho 0.74 (paper 0.60). The paper reports 10 participants (EMG) and 19 (force) with significant CMC (also in the authors' R script), but the Sign and Sign_F columns of the deposit flag 15 and 22 participants; the flags are kept as given and the counts are not used as checks. The paper's window means are only in a figure. The preprint is CC BY-ND while the OSF deposit states no license; the paper was later published in Eur J Neurosci (10.1111/ejn.70600)."
